*Formula Sheet: Operators & Commutators*

- *Commutator Definitions & Algebra:*
  $ [A, B] = A B - B A $
  $ [A, B] = -[B, A] $
  $ [A + B, C] = [A, C] + [B, C] $
  $ [A B, C] = A[B, C] + [A, C]B $
  $ [A, B C] = [A, B]C + B[A, C] $

- *Canonical Commutation Relation:*
  $ [x, p] = i planck $
  $ p = -i planck dif / (dif x) quad text("(position representation)") $

- *Hermitian & Unitary Operators:*
  - Hermitian ($A = A^dagger$): $chevron.l A psi | phi chevron.r = chevron.l psi | A phi chevron.r$ (real eigenvalues).
  - Unitary ($U^dagger = U^(-1)$): $chevron.l U psi | U phi chevron.r = chevron.l psi | phi chevron.r$ (preserves normalization).
